e eyebrow, heavy brows and an unusually delicate jaw, and a favorite piece of clothing, a narrow-striped sweater. It usually goes with a folded shopping list secured by a miniature clip. When somebody else has the floor, Vera listens with the head tilted a little to the left.","personality":"Vera feels a room through sound. A door slammed in high spirits can produce the same instant startle as an angry one, and it takes a little while to hear what actually follows.","agenda":"To recover the unused refund for a second ticket.","family":"Jesse Starr is Vera’s half-sibling. Vera asks what the birthday guest would like this year. Jesse remembers the birthdays. A present that was perfect at sixteen may be completely wrong at forty. They take the trouble of finding out. Asked about *The tide clock*, Jesse says, “I gave the employee a warning before I checked the dial.”","connections":"Kai Ibrahim (savings club member). A deferred holiday and an unused refund may create a second journey.","familyIds":["AH-R0442"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0472"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A donor asks for the club's name in return for a ticket","response":"Vera asks the members to hear the terms before deciding on a name.","asWritten":"A donor asks for the club's name in return for a ticket. Vera asks the members to hear the terms before deciding on a name."},{"situation":"A street musician can't finish a familiar song","response":"Vera keeps listening through the pause and lets the musician choose the next note.","asWritten":"A street musician can't finish a familiar song. Vera keeps listening through the pause and lets the musician choose the next note."},{"situation":"If an argument gets loud at home","response":"Vera lowers their own voice and asks for one thought at a time.","asWritten":"If an argument gets loud at home, Vera lowers their own voice and asks for one thought at a time."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_bob02","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"nam